# M17 armour over the network, flow "m17_two_clients" side A (EnterLevel = 13, EnterCoins = 5000): an Aydor warrior
# buys the Yeminli heavy chest and legs at Demirci Ilgaz and puts them on (real ITEM_MOVEs: ENTITY_EQUIP carries the
# armour), sits down as the signal for B (m17_two_b.voscript), waits for the Kargan of B to come over in its own leather
# and checks B's armour as this client received it; then the select screen shows the armour on the preview figure.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m17_two_a
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Zirhli
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown+npcs2 1800
scene talk Demirci Ilgaz
waitfor world+shopopen+inv 900
scene shopbuy 116
waitfor world+modal 120
clickon messagebox.button0
waitfor world+bought1+shopidle 600
scene shopbuy 117
waitfor world+modal 120
clickon messagebox.button0
waitfor world+bought2+shopidle 600
key escape
wait 10
scene expectbag 1 116
scene expectbag 2 117
scene itemmove bag1 chest
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene itemmove bag2 legs
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene inventory close
wait 30
scene armorlog
scene expectlocalarmor 2
scene camera front 10 3.2
wait 15
screenshot two_a_own_armour.png
scene stance sit
waitfor world+serversitting 300
waitfor world+remotes1 3600
scene markremote Derici
waitfor world+remotenear8 3600
waitfor world+remotestill 3600
wait 30
scene expectremotearmor Derici 0 121 122 0 0
scene camera at:Derici 14 4.5
wait 15
screenshot two_a_sees_b.png
scene stance stand
waitfor world+upright 300
wait 60
key escape
waitfor world+menu 60
clickon world.menu.charselect
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
wait 30
scene expectpreviewarmor 2
screenshot two_a_select_preview.png
quit
